<div class='container'>
    <div class='title'>
        <h3>Max Payout Setting Information</h3>
    </div>
    <div class='main-content'>
        <p> Max Payout Per Match is a setting that controls the total max payout of all tickets of the same match.</p>
        <div class='paragraph'>
            <h4>For Example: </h4>
            <ol>
                <li>Given that max payout per match = 1,000</li>
                <li>
                    If member places the first ticket with Odds = 10, Stake = 70, the ticket will have:
                    <ul>
                        <li>Max Bet = Max Payout Per Match / Odds = 1,000 / 10 = 100.</li>
                        <li>Max Payout = Stake * Odds = 70 * 10 = 700 = Accumulated Max Payout*</li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>
                    If member places the second ticket with Odds = 5, the ticket will have:
                    <ul>
                        <li>Max Bet = (Max Payout Per Match - Accumulated Max Payout) / Odds = (1,000 - 700) / 5 = 60.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class='note'>Note: Accumulated Max Payout is the Max Payout of all tickets of the same match excludes the Void/Reject tickets. Therefore, if the first ticket is voided, Max Bet of the second ticket = (1,000 - 0)/5 = 200.</p>
                </li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        <ul>
            <li class="style-double-asterisk">
                <p><b>For Parlay ticket:</b> Max Payout is applied to all bet types.</p>
                <p>
                    Parlay Max Payout Per Match: The system accumulates the max payout of all running parlay tickets and uses it together with the setting value to calculate the next
                    ticket max bet. The max bet calculation is different between Single Match Parlay and Mix/Combo Parlay.
                </p>
                <ul >
                    <li>
                        <b>Single Match Parlay:</b> Max Bet = (Parlay Max Payout Per Match Setting - Accumulated Max Payout of the same match) / Odds
                        <div class='note'>Note: Single Match Parlay does not count Mix/Combo Parlay ticket</div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Mix/Combo Parlay:</b> Max Bet = (Parlay Max Payout Per Match Setting - Accumulated Max Payout of the all matches) / Odds
                        <div class='note'> Note: Mix/Combo Parlay does not count Single Match Parlay tickets</div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    Accumulated max payout counts all running tickets. It will be released if any running tickets are settled/rejected/refunded/voided.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="style-double-asterisk">
                <b>For Normal ticket:</b>
                <p>Max Payout setting is applied to all bet types of Sportsbook except the bet types listed in the table below.</p>
                <div class='table-content'>
                    <table>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Bet types that do not apply Max Payout setting</th>
                        </tr>
                        <tr><td>Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Over/Under</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>1X2</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>1H Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>1H Over/Under</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>1H 1X2</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Moneyline</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>1H Moneyline</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Game Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Match Winner</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Quarter X Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Quarter X Over/Under</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Quarter X Moneyline</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Match Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Match Point Handicap</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Match Point Over/Under</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Super Over Winner</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Home Inns Runs</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Away Inns Runs</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Home 1st Inns Runs</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Away 1st Inns Runs</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Home 2nd Inns Runs</td></tr>
                        <tr><td>Away 2nd Inns Runs</td></tr>
                    </table>
                </div>

            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>